{"pageid":1918,"title":"Lab Card","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lab Card</span>","revid":20565,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #3C3C3C; background:#505050; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p style=\"margin-bottom:.3em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:semi-bold\">This page is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Stubs\" title=\"Category:Stubs\">stub</a>!</span><br />\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Lab_Card?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i>\"LabCard_description\"</i>\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Lab Card</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4b/Lab_Card.png/revision/latest?cb=20231122010539\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Lab Card\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4b/Lab_Card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231122010539\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4b/Lab_Card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231122010539 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4b/Lab_Card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20231122010539 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Lab Card\" width=\"270\" height=\"199\" data-image-key=\"Lab_Card.png\" data-image-name=\"Lab Card.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Snowy Peaks</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Granting access to the second floor of the Observatory</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Lab Card</b> is an item that is obtained as part of the Hidden Vials quest in the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowy Peaks</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Lab Card</b> is an item that allows players into the second floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Observatory</a>. It is a blue card with a white strip and white text. The text states \"C-09\" on the right side of the card, and <a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Burk\" title=\"Alan Burk\">Alan Burk</a>'s name on the left side of the card.\n</p><p>On the reverse side of the card, the text is mirrored, but there is an additional barcode. Most of the barcode is obstructed, leaving only two thin strips of red dots. Connecting these to each other vertically reveals the full barcode, which is encoded using <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_39\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wp:Code 39\">Code 39</a>. The barcode resolves to <code>*HERRING*</code>.\n</p><p>The barcode is a reference to a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_herring\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wp:Red herring\">red herring</a>, something deliberately intended to mislead or distract from the original question. The barcode itself is red, and the encoded text is <code>*HERRING*</code>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"3eb75e7044f44eae02abb0e96489e6c8\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Lab_Card_code-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Lab_Card_code.png\" title=\"Lab Card code.png (110 KB)\" style=\"height:136px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/89/Lab_Card_code.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240304195708\" title=\"Lab Card code.png (110 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Connected dots\" height=\"136\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Lab Card code.png\" data-image-key=\"Lab_Card_code.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Connected dots\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Lab Card code.png (110 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Connected dots\" height=\"136\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Lab Card code.png\" data-image-key=\"Lab_Card_code.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Connected dots\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/89/Lab_Card_code.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240304195708\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Connected dots</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"HERRING_code-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:64px; width:185px; top:36px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:HERRING_code.png\" title=\"HERRING code.png (4 KB)\" style=\"height:64px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/HERRING_code.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240304195709\" title=\"HERRING code.png (4 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"*HERRING* barcode\" height=\"99\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"HERRING code.png\" data-image-key=\"HERRING_code.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"*HERRING* barcode\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"HERRING code.png (4 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"*HERRING* barcode\" height=\"99\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"HERRING code.png\" data-image-key=\"HERRING_code.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"*HERRING* barcode\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/HERRING_code.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240304195709\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">*HERRING* barcode</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p>Obtaining the Lab Card requires the player to get into the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowy Peaks</a>. They must find the <a href=\"/wiki/Lab\" title=\"Lab\">Lab</a>, and speak to to the <a href=\"/wiki/Unknown_Person\" title=\"Unknown Person\">Unknown Person</a> within the lab. \n</p><p>They must then find <i>five</i> separate vials within the Snowy Peaks, and return them to the Unknown Person, who will give them the Lab Card in return for the vials. These vials can be collected in any order the player desires, as long as they are all returned to the Unknown Person at the same time.\n</p><p>WARNING: this quest will expire with time. If you take too long to gather all of the vials they will respawn and you will need to go back to the lab and talk to the <a href=\"/wiki/Unknown_Person\" title=\"Unknown Person\">Unknown Person</a> again. \n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_locations_of_the_vials_are_as_follows:\">The locations of the vials are as follows:</span></h2>\n<p>Vial #1 is located on the far left of the biome. \n</p><p>Starting from the map at the desert entrance take the path to the left and take the immediate ramp on the right to the very top, go down the dip then up the ramp on the left, follow it to the corner of that area and the first vial will be waiting for you to claim \n</p><p>Starting from the Lab, go between the two ramps on either side, and continue upwards, when at the two ramps go up the right one, and continue upwards until you get to the frozen Y lake, follow the shore left and cross the lake once arriving at the part where it becomes a waterfall, from that point on, take the first ramp on your left and go all the way upwards, once at the dip, go down, up the first ramp on your left and follow the edge till the corner, your vial will be waiting \n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 478px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Vial_image_1.png/revision/latest?cb=20250408031902\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Vial image 1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Vial_image_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/478?cb=20250408031902\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"478\" height=\"269\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Vial image 1.png\" data-image-key=\"Vial_image_1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Vial_image_1.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Vial #2 is located on the right side of the biome. \n</p><p>From the Lab, Follow the same directions as mentioned in Vial #1 to get to the frozen Y lake, cross immediately, be careful not the fall in the holes in the ice! Hug the right wall until you reach the ramp and head up it. Continue along the path and take the first ramp on the left, follow the series of ramps until you reach the top. Once at the top travel straight ahead to the edge of the cliff where the vial should be sitting. \n</p><p>From the desert map, head up the slope past the ramps until you arrive at the frozen Y lake, cross it and continue straight, staying on the snow until you get to the ramp after the ski lift, head up the ramp and follow the walls until you take the next ramp on the left following the series of ramps until you reach the top. Once at the top, travel straight ahead to the edge of the cliff where the vial should be sitting \n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 480px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2a/Vial_3.png/revision/latest?cb=20250408034348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Vial 3\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"480\" height=\"270\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Vial 3.png\" data-image-key=\"Vial_3.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2a/Vial_3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/480?cb=20250408034348\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2a/Vial_3.png/revision/latest?cb=20250408034348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Vial 3\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2a/Vial_3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/480?cb=20250408034348\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"480\" height=\"270\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Vial 3.png\" data-image-key=\"Vial_3.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2a/Vial_3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/480?cb=20250408034348\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Vial_3.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Vial #3 is on the right of the biome near Vial #2 \n</p><p>Starting from the first ramp from Vial #2's Taiga directions, Follow the lake until you see what looks like a cliff, but the edge is snowy, this is where the path dips down extremely sharply. Most cars do not have the acceleration to get back up this cliff after going down, so if you are driving, make sure to leave your vehicle at the top of the dip and carry the vial back up manually. \n</p><p>Down the cliff on the rocks to the left, the Vial is sitting in the middle of the rock. \n</p><p>\nStarting from the Frozen Y lake, Follow it until you get to an area where the edge looks like a snow covered cliff ledge, the path dips down extremely sharply, but if you scoot forward car near the edge, you will see the vial, do not drive down however as most cars do not have the appropriate acceleration to go back up. Instead walk down the path and carry the vial back up </p><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 485px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3e/Vial_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20250408034953\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Vial 4\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"485\" height=\"273\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Vial 4.png\" data-image-key=\"Vial_4.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3e/Vial_4.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/485?cb=20250408034953\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3e/Vial_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20250408034953\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Vial 4\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3e/Vial_4.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/485?cb=20250408034953\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"485\" height=\"273\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Vial 4.png\" data-image-key=\"Vial_4.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3e/Vial_4.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/485?cb=20250408034953\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Vial_4.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Vial #4 is also located on the right side of the biome near Vial #2. \n</p><p>From the first ramp in Vial #2' s Taiga directions, turn left and Head up to the Ski Lift, sharply turn right once you reach the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowdrift_Station_A_%26_B\" title=\"Snowdrift Station A &amp; B\">cable car</a> station. Hug the right wall until you see the vial!\n</p><p>From the sharp dip for vial #3's Frozen lake Directions, continue following the lake until you see the sign for the ski lift, turn left and Head up to it, sharply turn right once you reach the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowdrift_Station_A_%26_B\" title=\"Snowdrift Station A &amp; B\">cable car</a> station. Hug the right wall until you see the vial!\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 491px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Vial_5.png/revision/latest?cb=20250408035336\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Vial 5\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"491\" height=\"276\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Vial 5.png\" data-image-key=\"Vial_5.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Vial_5.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/491?cb=20250408035336\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Vial_5.png/revision/latest?cb=20250408035336\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Vial 5\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Vial_5.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/491?cb=20250408035336\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"491\" height=\"276\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Vial 5.png\" data-image-key=\"Vial_5.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/80/Vial_5.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/491?cb=20250408035336\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Vial_5.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Vial #5 is located on the far left of the biome on the ramp above the entrance to the lab.\n</p><p>From the Lab, hug the left wall until you pass a ramp, head up this ramp and when possible turn right, there you will see a vial waiting for you to bring to the stranger.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 478px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Vial_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20250408032655\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Vial 2\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"478\" height=\"269\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Vial 2.png\" data-image-key=\"Vial_2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Vial_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/478?cb=20250408032655\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Vial_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20250408032655\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Vial 2\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Vial_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/478?cb=20250408032655\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"478\" height=\"269\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Vial 2.png\" data-image-key=\"Vial_2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Vial_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/478?cb=20250408032655\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Vial_2.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\nIt is encouraged to use the free cam option if players struggle to find the vials. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When hovering over the Lab Card, one of the interaction options is \"?&#160;?&#160;?\". This  option currently does nothing.</li>\n<li>When inspecting the card, the description says \"LabCard_description\". This is likely due to the fact that the item is new, and no localized strings for the description have been made.</li>\n<li>The card is equippable in a new \"pocket\" slot, which currently can contain either this or the Red version. Although it still has no function</li>\n<li>The vials can not be saved onto your plot, kept in crates, or stored in drawers.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901181855\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 99/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 562/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2967/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019476/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.631      1 -total\n 88.77%   27.191      1 Template:Objects\n 11.04%    3.382      1 Template:Stub\n  5.14%    1.574      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1918-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901181855 and revision id 20565. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Stubs"],"links":[{"title":"Category:Stubs","exists":true},{"title":"Alan Burk","exists":true},{"title":"Gizmo's Observatory","exists":true},{"title":"Lab","exists":true},{"title":"Snowdrift Station A & B","exists":true},{"title":"Snowlands","exists":true},{"title":"Unknown Person","exists":true}],"images":["Lab_Card.png","Lab_Card_code.png","HERRING_code.png","Vial_image_1.png","Vial_3.png","Vial_4.png","Vial_5.png","Vial_2.png"]}
